abstract: >-
  Spectra AI is a computational software framework for structure-based
  estimation of UV–Visible absorption maxima and modelled spectral generation
  under selected solvent and experimental-condition inputs. The software
  integrates cheminformatics, machine-learning predictors, analogue-based
  information, empirical spectral rules, optional quantum-chemical calculations,
  adaptive refinement, and visualization.
